From: nix-config integration <noreply@local>
Subject: [PATCH] agentmemory: stabilize context and persist file enrichment

Applies after opencode-capture.patch to AgentMemory e04ba888.
Keep startup context fixed for a loaded session. Attach fresh enrichment to
new persisted results rather than replacing the prefix before all history.
Standard capture routes, timeouts, retrieval, and compaction remain intact.

--- a/plugin/opencode/agentmemory-capture.ts
+++ b/plugin/opencode/agentmemory-capture.ts
@@ -2,1 +2,2 @@
 import { execFileSync } from "node:child_process";
